    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just ate some shrimp at this new place and my skin is getting really itchy and red like all over my arms. my face feels kind of puffy too. is it okay if i just take a benadryl and wait for it to go down? or should i be worried about the tightness i'm feeling in my throat?",
